1
00:00:16,976 --> 00:00:20,624
Hello, Peter and Helen! This is my grandpa.

2
00:00:21,072 --> 00:00:24,688
Hello, Mr Fu. Nice to meet you!

3
00:00:24,768 --> 00:00:31,504
Nice to meet you too. Welcome to my house. Let me show you around.

4
00:00:31,664 --> 00:00:37,760
Thank you. Oh, what’s that, Mr Fu? Is that a goose?

5
00:00:37,936 --> 00:00:41,344
No, it isn’t. It’s a duck.

6
00:00:51,264 --> 00:00:56,768
Mr Fu, what are those plants? Are they potato plants?

7
00:00:57,024 --> 00:01:01,216
No, Peter, they aren’t. They’re carrot plants.

8
00:01:01,408 --> 00:01:05,792
What about these plants? Are they tomato plants?

9
00:01:06,352 --> 00:01:08,016
Yes, they are!

10
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:21,152
What kind of tree is this? It’s an apple tree.

11
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:25,552
How many apple trees do you have? Only two.

12
00:01:25,808 --> 00:01:31,184
Look at those rabbits. They’re cute! How many rabbits do you have?

13
00:01:31,424 --> 00:01:36,672
I have 12 rabbits. Eight are white, and four are black.

